{"id":"n29040-1-7","stage":2,"title":"서서히 · 慢慢地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29040-1-7-1","ko":"담배를 한 번에 끊기가 너무 어렵네요.","zh":"一下子就戒烟实在太难了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"담배를","meaning":"烟，香烟","explanation":"담배：烟，香烟；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"담배","audio":"/audio/10c7c905412d52542ee4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63662","senseId":"2","lemma":"담배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"一","explanation":"한：一","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"번에","meaning":"次，遍","explanation":"번：次，遍；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"2","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끊기가","meaning":"戒","explanation":"끊다：戒；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"끊다","audio":"/audio/c2d51c5ca94e5957669b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62839","senseId":"4","lemma":"끊다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어렵네요.","meaning":"难，不容易","explanation":"어렵다：难，不容易；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"어렵다","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62232","senseId":"1","lemma":"어렵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"10c7c905412d5254","term":"담배","zh":"烟，香烟","audio":"/audio/10c7c905412d52542ee4.mp3","entryId":"63662","definition":"把晒干的烟叶切成细条用纸卷起，制成点火后供吸入其烟雾的物品。","pronunciation":["담ː배"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"一个的。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"dfcc